// Run from the Appeal folder with the SDL2 Network plugin configured.
// Connect TCP chat clients to port 1234; messages are broadcast to all clients,
// including the sender. The SDL2 server listens on all network interfaces.
Network Debug On
Network Configure Chat 10.0.0. 1234
Network Server

Print "Chat server started. Connect clients to port 1234."
Print "Press Ctrl+C to stop the server."

// The Network plugin accepts clients and relays messages in the background.
Loop While 1 == 1
{
    Delay 1
}
Return
